{"ref":"BDB, מַחְלָה","hw":"מַחְלָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְלָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.f. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  a daughter of Zelophehad <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:33\" href=\"/Numbers.26.33\">Nu 26:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 27:1\" href=\"/Numbers.27.1\">27:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 36:11\" href=\"/Numbers.36.11\">36:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:3\" href=\"/Joshua.17.3\">Jos 17:3</a>, 𝔊 Μα(α)λ(α)α.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a Gileadite name (poss. <strong>m.</strong>) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.18\">1 Ch 7:18</a> 𝔊 Μαελα, 𝔊L Μααλαθ.","next":"BDB, מַחֲלֶה²","prev":"BDB, מְחִיָּיאֵל"}